   1  # Harness server (repository: harness)
   2  Agent
   3  go-developer (planning only, no code until the person approves)
   4  Decision
   5  The person chose A + B + C over one text view, with a size guard, plus F.
   6  What changes at the boundary
   7  read_task_document / read_project_document take offset/limit, section and view.
   8  New search_documents across task documents, project documents and, optionally, text artifacts.
   9  Document listings carry bytes, lines and version.
  10  Constraints
  11  Backward compatible: a call without the new arguments on a document under the guard returns exactly what it returns today, plus metadata.
  12  Error messages begin with their code, because agents over MCP see messages only.
  13  read_task_document { document_id, offset?, limit? }
  14    → { document, lines?, outline? }
